  "design_rules_for_nereis": [
    "Do not reproduce Hallownest room geometry or original map pixels; use the macro topology as a structural reference.",
    "Keep Nereis region names, lore, assets, and A0-A13/H01-H08 identifiers.",
    "Build several routes between important hubs; do not make every area a single linear chain.",
    "Place some routes above or below the main path, with supported landings and actual playable transitions.",
    "Use ability gates, one-way drops, shortcuts opened from the far side, and hidden entries as different mechanics.",
    "A player who ignores optional branches must still be able to complete the main ending.",
